Revision history for oEdtk

2.1102      2026-10-06
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: new csv_import fast path for PostgreSQL using COPY ... FROM STDIN, the native equivalent of the MySQL LOAD DATA LOCAL INFILE path. It is selected automatically for the Pg driver when the import mode is not "merge"; rows are first cleaned through the same _get_col_meta / _make_clean_val pipeline into a temporary file, so truncation and '' => NULL conversion match the row-by-row path. New private helpers _load_csv_pg_copy, _pg_csv_field and _pg_encoding_name.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: _load_csv_pg_copy reads records with Text::CSV getline (instead of parse) so that a quoted field may span several physical lines; COPY runs with FORMAT csv, the current separator/quote characters and NULL '' so an unquoted empty field is read back as NULL.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: _load_csv_pg_copy re-encodes each row to the session client_encoding (from SHOW client_encoding, mapped to an Encode name) before pg_putcopydata, so multibyte values are stored correctly. New dependencies: File::Temp and Encode.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: $VERSION 2.1071 → 2.1101 during the PostgreSQL COPY work.
    - New test suite under t/ (Test::More): 00_load.t, 10_main_date.t, 11_main_num.t, 12_main_text.t, 20_fields.t, 21_dict_tags.t, 30_dbadmin_pure.t, 31_dbadmin_sqlite.t, 40_tracking_validate.t and 50_edms_pure.t, plus t/lib/TestOEdtk.pm (shared helpers), t/edtk.ini (test configuration) and t/test_csv_pg_copy.pl (PostgreSQL COPY import check).
    - README.md: the former plain-text README was merged into README.md and the CONTENT OF THIS ARCHIVE section rewritten with the actual package tree; copyright year updated 2024 → 2026.
    - oEdtk.pm: $VERSION 2.1071 → 2.1102.

2.1071      2026-07-01
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: _get_col_meta now distinguishes text types (varchar, character varying, char, bpchar, text) from numeric and date/time types. The truncation size is only used for text columns; numeric and date/time columns get a new blank_to_null flag. This fixes erroneous truncation of values on PostgreSQL (e.g. a date 2026-07-09 was being truncated to 2026 because column_info returns the internal storage size for non-text types).
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: _make_clean_val — empty-string → undef conversion now applies to both numeric AND date/time columns (blank_to_null), fixing PostgreSQL "invalid input syntax for type date" errors.
    - oEdtk.pm: version bump to 2.1071.
    - Makefile.PL / README.md: copyright year updated 2024 → 2026.
    - META.json / META.yml: version bump only.

2.1065      2026-06-05
    - oEdtk.pm: version bump to 2.1065; copyright year in the POD LICENCE section updated 2024 → 2026.
    - META.json / META.yml: version bump only.

2.1064      2026-06-04
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: $VERSION = 2.1063; new $VERSION_TXT (version with dots replaced by underscores, used in index names). admin_check_db renamed to acheck_db_admin_on_connect; private _drop_table renamed to public db_drop_table (new export).
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: massive SQL rewrite to lowercase keywords and identifiers throughout (all maintenance queries, purges, rotations, table creation) for portability across MySQL / PostgreSQL / Oracle / SQLite. _sql_fixup gained a third $mysqlCasse argument: for MySQL the whole SQL is uppercased (except INSERT/REPLACE statements); for PostgreSQL empty strings '' are converted to NULL in VALUES/SET clauses; VARCHAR2→VARCHAR conversion is now case-insensitive.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: insert_tData rewritten — driver-aware identifier case normalization (_norm_identifiers, uc for MySQL/MariaDB, lc otherwise), column metadata lookup (_get_col_meta via DBI column_info, with a SELECT * WHERE 1=0 fallback for drivers like SQLite), and value cleaning (_make_clean_val: empty string → undef for numeric columns, truncation to declared column size). Old implementations kept as insert_tData_deprecated_1 / insert_tData_deprecated_2.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: csv_import rewritten with the same metadata/cleaning pipeline; old versions kept as csv_import_deprecated_1/2/3; new private helpers _norm_identifiers, _get_col_meta, _make_clean_val.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: db_connect — FetchHashKeyName is now configurable via EDTK_DB_FetchHashKeyName (default NAME_uc); the TRACKING table is auto-created on connect if missing (_table_exists); the auto DB check now only runs when EDTK_DB_CHECK_AUTO is explicitly YES (previously defaulted to YES when unset); calls acheck_db_admin_on_connect instead of admin_check_db.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: new _table_exists helper (DBI table_info); new acheck_db_admin2 (on-demand maintenance job) built on new _db_maintenance and _db_with_lock (locking via an edtk_admin insert).
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: _db_check_driver_name hardened (returns "NC" for an invalid/unconnected $dbh); old version kept as _db_check_driver_name_deprecated.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: admin_optimize_db rewritten — driver detected per connection, no-op select 1 for NC/Oracle, REPAIR TABLE/OPTIMIZE TABLE for MySQL, VACUUM FULL for PostgreSQL; old version kept as admin_optimize_db_deprecated.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: index names changed from ix.$VERSION.$table (dot-separated) to ix_${table}_${VERSION_TXT} (underscore-separated, portable) and use create index if not exists. create_lot_sequence now issues create sequence if not exists edtk_idlot minvalue 0 maxvalue 999 cycle through _sql_fixup.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: all column-definition arrays (@TRACKER_COLS, @DISTRIB_COLS, @AGREGE_COLS, @INDEX_COLS) converted to lowercase column names. create_table_OUTMNGR: ed_ididx no longer NOT NULL; ed_nbdocpli and ed_numpgpli no longer NOT NULL. move_table, db_backup_agent, schema_Upgrade, schema_Create: lowercase SQL and _sql_fixup(..., 'casse').
    - lib/oEdtk/logger2.pm: package renamed from oEdtk::logger2 to oEdtk::logger (the file is still logger2.pm); $VERSION = 1.9062. New exported subs set_logger_level($) and set_warn_to_logger(). Letter-based level normalization: new %hLETTER_LEVEL maps letters (H, F, C, E, S, X, W, A, I, P, L, D, U) to numeric levels; logger() now accepts a letter as the level or as the modifier argument. _DEBUG_ and _CONTXT_ constants swapped: _DEBUG_ = 7, _CONTXT_ = 8 (previously reversed). Log line format changed to >%date| %-7s|FH-%07d|PID-%s|last RC: %0.3d| %s|last RC: %0.3d-%s. logger() return value changed: scalar context returns $rcLogger[0] (or the joined string for FAIL level); list context returns @rcLogger. usage_logger renamed to logger_help; logger_help now takes an optional argument controlling whether logger_rc_list is printed.
    - oEdtk::Tracking: track sub — the table name is now uppercased when the driver is MySQL (identifier case fix); stats_week, stats_iddest, stats_month: SQL converted to lowercase.
    - oEdtk::Config: use oEdtk::logger now explicitly imports qw(logger $LOGGERLEVEL $WARN2LOGGER).
    - oEdtk::TexDoc / oEdtk::TexTag: trivial — trailing newline at end of file removed (no functional change).
    - oEdtk.pm: version bump only.

1.9013      2024-01-03
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: create_table_INDEX renamed to create_table_OUTMNGR; exports updated (added create_table_TRACKING, create_table_OUTMNGR, create_table_DISTRIB, removed create_table_INDEX). All CREATE TABLE statements changed to CREATE TABLE if not exists (idempotent schema creation).
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: create_table_TRACKING — added ENGINE=MyISAM for MySQL; added an index on ED_TSTAMP (skipped for SQLite). This fixes a bug creating the Tracking table in SQLite.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: create_table_DISTRIB — PRIMARY KEY removed and replaced by a composite index ix.$VERSION.$table on (ED_IDLDOC, ED_SEQDOC, ED_IDSEQPG, ED_IDJOB, ED_CHANEL_OUT, ED_DTLOT); ENGINE=MyISAM for MySQL.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: create_table_AGREGE — PRIMARY KEY removed, replaced by a composite index; @AGREGE_COLS gains a new ED_TSTAMP VARCHAR2(14) NOT NULL column; ED_CNTD_IDLDOC type changed from VARCHAR2(25) to INTEGER; ED_IDJOB column moved after ED_IDLOT.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: create_table_OUTMNGR (ex-INDEX) — the three separate indexes (ED_DTEDTION, ED_SEQLOT, ED_TYPPROD) replaced by a single composite index; ENGINE=MyISAM for MySQL. create_table_ID: index renamed to ix.$VERSION.ED_ID_DATE; ENGINE=MyISAM for MySQL. create_table_ACQUIT: ENGINE=MyISAM for MySQL.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: schema_Create — signature simplified to a single $dbh argument (dropped $table/$maxkeys); no longer creates the TRACKING table; calls create_table_OUTMNGR.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: admin_optimize_db — signature changed from ($dbh) to hash-based (CFG => $cfg); now runs a REPAIR then an OPTIMIZE pass per table, connecting/disconnecting for each table; MySQL uses REPAIR TABLE + OPTIMIZE TABLE, other drivers a no-op SELECT * ... LIMIT 1.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: the EDTK_AGREGE rotation INSERT ... SELECT now writes a new ED_TSTAMP stamp column and adds ED_IDJOB to the GROUP BY. acheck_db_admin/admin_check_db: EDTK_DB_MAX_DAYS_AGREGED now falls back to EDTK_DB_MAX_DAYS_TRACKED when not configured.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: bug fix — error messages "..." . $DBI::errstr || "undefined" had an operator-precedence bug; fixed to ($DBI::errstr || "not defined"). Added &logger(7, $sql) debug logging to most SQL statements.
    - oEdtk::Main: END block — _restore_sys_date; uncommented — the system date is now actually restored at program exit (previously commented out). oe_define_TeX_output re-indented only (no functional change).
    - oEdtk::Outmngr: create_table_INDEX → create_table_OUTMNGR rename in the use oEdtk::DBAdmin import and in the SQLite table-creation call.
    - lib/oEdtk/iniEdtk/tplate.edtk.ini: [ENVDESC] — EDTK_DIR_BASE now defaults to $EDTK_PRGPATH; added EDTK_DIR_DB, EDTK_DIR_DOCLIB, EDTK_DIR_EDOCMNGR; EDTK_TYPE_ENV default changed Production → Dev; EDTK_BIN_PERL now /usr/bin/perl (Linux default). New [EDTK_DB] section: full database configuration (SQLite default DSN, tracking keys, retention days, EDTK_DB_CHECK_AUTO=NO). New [EDTK_STATS] section: stats DSN/table aliases, CSV header definitions, stats SQL queries. [MAIL]: added EDTK_MAIL_TST. [COMPO]: EDTK_BIN_COMPO and EDTK_COMPO_LIB now use $EDTK_DIR_BASE / $EDTK_DIR_CONFIG (Linux paths). [COMSET] section removed entirely; old [EDTK_DB]/[EDTK_STATS] sections replaced by the new ones.
    - lib/oEdtk/lib/db_Schema_init.pl: create_SCHEMA → schema_Create (function renamed).
    - lib/oEdtk/COPYING: license text changed from GNU GPL v2 to GNU GPL v3.
    - lib/oEdtk/README: added copyright line, updated version, removed the whole TODO list and the AUTHORS section.

1.9012      2024-01-02
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: revert of the 1.8122/1.8123 changes — create_table_OUTMNGR renamed back to create_table_INDEX; the EDTK_DB_CHECK_AUTO bug fix reverted (back to the default-YES test); $VERSION 1.8101 → 1.8097.
    - lib/oEdtk/iniEdtk/tplate.edtk.ini: [EDTK_DB] section removed; Windows/Compuset configuration restored (EDTK_DIR_BASE=C:/editique, EDTK_TYPE_ENV=Production, EDTK_BIN_PERL=C:/Sources/Perl/bin).
    - lib/oEdtk/COPYING: license text back to GNU GPL v2.
    - oEdtk.pm: $VERSION 1.8123 → 1.9012, $YEAR 2025 → 2024; copyright 2005-2024.
    - Config.pm, Main.pm, Outmngr.pm, TexDoc.pm, TexTag.pm, db_Schema_init.pl, README: reverted to the pre-1.8122 state.

1.8123      2023-12-03
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: bug fix — the EDTK_DB_CHECK_AUTO test now checks `defined $cfg->{EDTK_DB_CHECK_AUTO} && $cfg->{EDTK_DB_CHECK_AUTO} !~ /NO/i` instead of `($cfg->{EDTK_DB_CHECK_AUTO}||"YES")!~/NO/i` (the value is defined by default to YES). $VERSION 1.8111 → 1.8123.
    - oEdtk.pm: $VERSION 1.8122 → 1.8123, $YEAR 2024 → 2025.
    - README.md: copyright year updated to 2025.
    - META.json / META.yml: version bump only.

1.8122      2023-12-02
    - New module lib/oEdtk/logger2.pm.
    - README renamed to README.md.
    - lib/oEdtk/COPYING: license text changed from GNU GPL v2 to GNU GPL v3.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: major rewrite — new subs admin_check_db, acheck_db_admin, agrege_idJob, schema_Create, schema_Upgrade, create_table_ADMIN, create_table_ID, create_table_AGREGE, create_table_OUTMNGR (renamed from create_table_INDEX); _drop_table_TRACKING → _drop_table; create_SCHEMA → schema_Create; new _load_csv_mysql_infile.
    - lib/oEdtk/iniEdtk/tplate.edtk.ini: new [EDTK_DB] and [EDTK_STATS] sections; [COMSET] removed; Linux paths ($EDTK_PRGPATH, /usr/bin/perl, Dev env).
    - New dependencies: Image::Size, Log::Log4perl, PDF::Create.
    - oEdtk.pm: $VERSION 1.5093 → 1.8122, $YEAR 2024.

1.5093      2020-09-03
    - New CHANGES file added.
    - Makefile.PL: MIN_PERL_VERSION => 5.010, LICENSE => 'perl'.
    - DBD::Oracle and DBD::Pg removed from META.yml/META.json and commented out in Makefile.PL.
    - oEdtk.pm: use strict; use warnings; added; version bump 1.5091 → 1.5093.

1.5091      2020-09-01
    - oEdtk.pm: require 5.10.0 (Perl 5.10.0 minimum); $VERSION 0.8052 → 1.5091.
    - New dependencies: YAML, CPAN::DistnameInfo, DBD::Excel, DBD::Oracle, DBD::Pg, DBD::SQLite, JSON, XML::Simple.
    - oEdtk::Config: config file lookup order changed — edtk.ini is now looked for in the program directory ($Bin) first, then in the perl module directory.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: new sub insert_tData (insert tracking data from outside); new sub _load_csv_mysql_local_infile (csv_import uses MySQL LOAD DATA LOCAL INFILE when mysql_local_infile is detected in the DSN); new @TRACKER_COLS and @DISTRIB_COLS column-definition arrays; tracking table gains ED_ACCOUNT column.
    - oEdtk::Tracking: track() now accepts entity/account/obj_typ/child_typ/child_id/parent_id parameters.
    - oEdtk::logger: WARN and DIE behaviour configurable via $WARN2LOGGER to report events into the tracking database.
    - oEdtk::trackEdtk: event levels extended — Job (default), Spool, Document, Line, Warning, Error, Halt (critic), Reject, Track; Halt events now logged via logger.

0.8052      2013-05-02
    - New file META.json.
    - lib/oEdtk/lib/html templates (edtk_ged.html, edtk_inged.html, index.html): hardcoded application/corporation names replaced with placeholder values (APP_1, APP_2, CORP_1, CORP_2, ...).
    - oEdtk.pm: $VERSION 0.8035 → 0.8052; $YEAR 2013; authors updated (G Ballin added, 2005-2013).
    - oEdtk::Tracking: version bump only.
    - META.yml: version bump.

0.8035      2013-03-05
    - oEdtk::Config: new sub get_ini_path() (returns the path of the ini file actually loaded); exported in @EXPORT_OK. $VERSION 0.8031 → 0.8034.
    - oEdtk::EDMS: EDMS_package signature changed from ($$$@) to ($$@) — the path argument removed; files are now added with their basename. $VERSION 0.8033 → 0.8035.
    - lib/oEdtk/lib/check_oEdtk_ini.pl: now uses get_ini_path() (warns "STARTING CHECK, loading config from ...").
    - oEdtk.pm: version bump 0.8034 → 0.8035.
    - META.yml: version bump.

0.8034      2013-03-04
    - oEdtk::EDMS: new sub EDMS_package($$$@) — packages several documents along with one index in a zip archive for later processing (writes $EDTK_DIR_EDOCMNGR/$app.$idldoc.out.zip); the existing package sub refactored (returns 1, prints the zipfile name). $VERSION 0.8031 → 0.8033.
    - libXls.pm: comment-only change.
    - oEdtk.pm: version bump 0.8032 → 0.8034.
    - META.yml: version bump.

0.8032.M.25.12.16      2025-12-16
    - Production fork (MNT) based on the 0.8032 codebase — a divergent branch, not a mainline
      release. It drops the whole Compuset/C7 subsystem and the tracking API, and adds ECM
      (Alfresco), REST emailing, Keycloak authentication, IBAN/BIC validation, QR codes and
      LaTeX index handling. The version string is not a valid CPAN version (kept as-is for
      traceability).
    - New modules: oEdtk::Utils (date/price parsing, tracking helpers, index formatting, string
      cleaning), oEdtk::FixIdx (even page counts in .idx files), oEdtk::LaTeX (latin-9 escaping,
      \gdef tags, index generation), oEdtk::Emailing (REST email via the nws_emailing service,
      requires Perl 5.028), oEdtk::Keycloak (OAuth2 client_credentials token, requires Perl
      5.020), oEdtk::Infinite (COBOL Infinite flow parsing), oEdtk::IBAN (IBAN/BIC validation),
      oEdtk::Constants (ECM document typology), oEdtk::Restitution (path-based value extraction),
      oEdtk::DisseminationPlan (REST dissemination plan), oEdtk::XML::DTD / oEdtk::XML::XSD /
      oEdtk::XML::DTD::Utils (XML validation against DTD/XSD).
    - oEdtk::Main: oe_ID_LDOC now generates a Data::UUID string instead of the numeric
      YWWWDHHMMSSPPPP.r format; new job-handling subs (oe_options, oe_params, oe_simple_job,
      oe_new_job_input_file, oe_new_job_output_file, oe_print_to_output_file,
      oe_get_handle_to_input_file, oe_typ_prod, oe_watermark, oe_backgrounds_apps,
      oe_config_compo, oe_clean_addr, oe_new_ID_LDOC); all Compuset/C7 functions removed
      (c7Flux, toC7date, fmt_address, fmt_address_sender, fmt_monetary, date2time,
      oe_CAP_sans_accents, oe_cdata_table_build, oe_close_fo, oe_compo_set_value,
      oe_csv2data_handles, oe_define_Compuset_output, oe_env_var_completion, oe_fmt_date,
      oe_outmngr_compo_run, oe_outmngr_full_run, oe_outmngr_output_run, oe_round, recEdtk_*,
      prodEdtk_*, oe_rec_output, oe_unique_data_name).
    - oEdtk::Run: new oe_background_pdf, update_idx, listing_depository (bpdf backgrounds via
      PDF::Tk + EDMS_BIN_PDFTK); oe_outmngr_output_run_tex handles recto-verso filières with
      make_docs_even_numbered and writes LOTPDF.txt in UTF-8; oe_after_compo honors
      EDTK_KEEP_OUT_FILE, supports the bpdf option, keeps the index file and checks the PDF
      exists; oe_status_to_msg returns '(status is zero)' for status 0.
    - oEdtk::EDMS: rewritten for Perl 5.20+ (signatures, IPC::Run3); 36-column index CSV with
      optional Alfresco header (EDMS_ACTIVATE_HEADER_ALFRESCO / EDMS_IDX_HEADER); new subs
      _log, my_system, preprend_alfresco_header_if_needed, EDMS_merge_docs; EDMS_import returns 0.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: new acquit processing (_acquit_API via oEUser::ECM, _acquit_table_INDEX,
      create_table_ACQMGENTECH, get_columns_names); csv_import does acquit processing + email
      report (EDTK_MAIL_ACQ) + uppercasing + ref_col; copy_table adds Oracle hints
      (PARALLEL 4 COMPRESS NOLOGGING PCTFREE 0); @INDEX_COLS gains 4 ECM columns; removed
      create_table_PARA, create_table_DATAGROUPS, _drop_table_TRACKING.
    - oEdtk::Config: use utf8; new read_hash sub; tie with -fallback => 'DEFAULT'; the hostname
      section is no longer merged last (mainline behavior).
    - oEdtk::RecordParser: denormalized handling split into set_denormalized_option_record /
      set_denormalized_on_record; byte cleaning via oEdtk::Utils::kill_non_latin_1_9_chars_in_place.
    - oEdtk::TexDoc: new append_qr_code, hhline_content, is_in_list (QR codes via Text::QRCode).
    - oEdtk::trackEdtk: tracking API removed (init_Tracking, track_Obj, define_Mod_Ed,
      define_Job_Evt, define_Job_User, define_Track_Key, open_Tracking_Env, test_exist_table,
      create_Track_Table, drop_Track_Table).
    - oEdtk::libDev: removed delSp, IdUniqueSur6, IdUniqueSur7, lastLong; run_Edtk_dev is
      LaTeX-only (no Compuset branch); bug fix in tree_Directory_Completion (numeric comparison).
    - oEdtk::libXls: removed prod_Xls_Add_Sheet. oEdtk::Spool: removed emit. oEdtk::Record:
      bind() semantics changed; bind_all/bind_all_c7 removed. oEdtk::Doc: $LINE_CUTOFF = 1
      (one TeX command per line).
    - New scripts lib/db_move.pl, lib/edms_runner.pl; acq_Load.pl removed.
    - New tests t/IBAN.pm.t, t/Utils.pm.t, t/FixIdx.pm.t.
    - cpanfile rewritten (replaces the Makefile.PL PREREQ_PM list); new dependencies Text::CSV_XS,
      XML::Simple, XML::Parser, XML::Encoding, Mail::Sender, Barcode::DataMatrix, PDF::API2,
      Hash::Merge::Simple, Hash::Flatten, MIME::Lite, Email::Valid, YAML::Tiny, Text::QRCode,
      Regexp::Common, PDF::Tk, Locale::PO, XML::LibXSLT, Text::Unaccent::PurePerl.
    - iniEdtk/edtk.ini added (mainline only ships tplate.edtk.ini): new [ENVDESC] keys
      (EDTK_XML_CATALOG_FILES, EDTK_DIR_FORMS, EDTK_DIR_BACKGROUNDS, ...), enriched [MAIL]
      section, [COMPO] lualatex switch (EDTK_COMPO_ASYNC), [EDOCMNGR] Alfresco keys,
      [EDTK_DB] and [EDTK_STATS] sections.

0.8032      2013-03-02
    - DBD::Oracle removed from META.yml and commented out in Makefile.PL (no longer a hard prerequisite).
    - Version bump only in lib/oEdtk.pm.

0.8031      2013-03-01
    - oEdtk::EDMS: archives may now contain .xls or .doc documents in addition to .pdf; non-PDF documents are no longer page-burst but moved to a Docubase-compatible filename via the new _docubase_file_name helper; EDMS_FILENAME derived from the ED_DOCLIB extension; EDMS_idx_process now captures the ED_DOCLIB value.
    - oEdtk::Tracking: application-name extraction regex now accepts hyphens and underscores; long application names truncated to the last 20 characters; new Reject (R) job event added to _validate_event.
    - oEdtk::Config: added a warning message when reading the template ini file (tplate.edtk.ini).
    - lib/oEdtk/lib/check_oEdtk_ini.pl: fixed the -h check to guard against an undefined $ARGV[0]; shebang changed to /usr/bin/perl.
    - New module lib/oEdtk/OmgrIdxDoc.pm (subclass of oEdtk::Doc) that builds an index CSV row from @INDEX_COLS tags (mktag/reset/dump).
    - New dependency DBD::Oracle added to META.yml and Makefile.PL.
    - README: authors updated (G Ballin added); install notes updated.

0.8022      2013-02-02
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: new sub copy_table (copies data from a source table into a target table; with -create it creates the target table first via CREATE TABLE AS SELECT; aborts with a warning if the source table is empty); move_table is now deprecated and delegates to copy_table; historicize_table now uses copy_table; new sub db_backup_agent backs up and purges old rows from the EDTK_DBI_TRACKING, EDTK_DBI_OUTMNGR and EDTK_DBI_ACQUIT tables based on the new EDTK_ENTIRE_YEARS_KEPT config.
    - oEdtk::Outmngr: encart (insert) validity — ED_DEBVALID equal to '99999999' is now treated as "no start date"; omgr_purge_fs now calls db_backup_agent before purging; doclibs referenced in the last EDTK_DCLIB_PURGE_WEEKS_KEPT weeks are now kept.
    - lib/oEdtk/lib/index_Purge_DCLIB.pl: fixed the -h check to guard against an undefined $ARGV[0].
    - New script lib/oEdtk/lib/db_copy.pl (CLI wrapper around copy_table: db_copy.pl table_source table_cible [-create]).
    - Removed script lib/oEdtk/lib/db_move.pl (replaced by db_copy.pl).

0.8021      2013-02-01
    - oEdtk::Tracking: new() — the source parameter now defaults to the command line ($ARGV[1] || $ARGV[0]) when not provided; if the value starts with '-' (an option), it falls back to $ARGV[0]. The tracking source is thus auto-detected from the command line.

0.8014      2013-01-04
    - oEdtk::Config: the Compuset-specific block that stripped environment-type extensions (EDTK_FTYP_TEST/HOMOL/PROD) from program names is now commented out as deprecated — the behavior is disabled.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: EDTK_LOTS table creation now includes a new column ED_CONSIGNE VARCHAR2(250).
    - oEdtk::Outmngr: omgr_export — the job CSV export now includes the new ED_CONSIGNE field; ED_LISTEREFIMP is now defaulted to "" when empty. omgr_stats — return format changed: the returned arrayref now starts with a printf format string and a header row; column order changed to put CORP first (then LOT, then ID_SEQLOT for idlot queries). Callers must now shift off the format/header.
    - oEdtk::Run: bug fix — intermediate-file cleanup after zipping is now skipped only for Dev/Debug environments ($type_env !~ /^De/i instead of !~ /D/); previously any environment whose name contained the letter "D" (e.g. PROD) was wrongly affected.
    - oEdtk::Tracking: job tracking now records the full command line (join(' ', @ARGV)) in the message zone of the Job event; the tracking insert now includes the ED_SOURCE field.
    - lib/oEdtk/lib/index_Block_refs.pl: removed the dependency on oEdtk::Outmngr; new feature — block/unblock by partial idldoc with a % wildcard (4-15 digits + %), using LIKE; bug fix — the STOP filter now filters on ED_STATUS instead of ED_SEQLOT; SQL refactored so the WHERE clause is shared between the SELECT and the UPDATE.
    - lib/oEdtk/lib/index_Run_lot.pl, index_Statistics.pl: adapted to the new omgr_stats return format (shift format string and header from the rows arrayref).
    - New dependency Roman added to META.yml and Makefile.PL.
