0.7121      2012-12-01
    - oEdtk::Main: new --noinputfiles command-line option — allows treatments without an input data file. Argument parsing reworked: defaults are merged into params earlier, help/usage handling moved into a conditional block, and the input file is only opened when an input file is actually provided; the IN handle is not closed when noinputfiles is set. Version bump 0.7007 → 0.7125.
    - oEdtk::Outmngr: omgr_check_acquit — postal code (CP) field is now truncated to 10 characters (first 4 + last 6) when longer than 10; job ticket file now includes ED_PRIORITE, ED_REFIDDOC, and ED_REFENC fields (fields reordered); added commented-out TODO for ED_REFENC/lot handling in the lot-matching UPDATE. Version bump 0.7031 → 0.7121.
    - oEdtk::Run: oe_outmngr_output_run_tex — the [MTD] type check is commented out, so lotissement is no longer suspended for non-Mass/Debug/Test types; deletion of intermediate files is now controlled by the EDTK_TYPE_ENV config value instead of the $type parameter. Version bump 0.7006 → 0.7111.
    - oEdtk::DBAdmin: EDTK_LOTS schema — ED_REFENC widened VARCHAR2(20) → VARCHAR2(32); EDTK_INDEX schema — ED_REFIMP widened VARCHAR2(8) → VARCHAR2(16); ED_IDLOT widened VARCHAR2(6) → VARCHAR2(8). Version bump 0.7031 → 0.7111.
    - oEdtk (main module): version bump 0.7029 → 0.7121; copyright year updated to 2013.
    - Documentation: README added XML-LibXML installation instructions (PPM on Windows, distribution package installer on Linux).

