0.7027      2012-02-07
    - oEdtk::Record: new seek_key attribute (default "LIGNE.{153}(.{10})") and new set_seek_key() method to override it; parse() no longer slices off the first fields_offset characters before unpacking (that logic is commented out); the full line is now unpacked; template building no longer inserts a space between fields (commented out). Version bump 0.04 → 0.7005.
    - oEdtk::RecordParser: new dumper() method (a Data::Dumper wrapper); new Data::Dumper dependency; new() now builds a seek_keys hash from each record's seek_key; undef records are ignored; parsing loop rewritten — instead of matching mute_record/line_record with a fixed key_offset/key_size, it now tries each registered seek_key regex (SEEK block); unknown records are now warned and ignored instead of dying with "Unexpected record identifier". Version bump 0.04 → 0.7005.
    - oEdtk (main module): version bump 0.7025 → 0.7027.
    - Packaging: META.yml and Makefile.PL added Data::Dumper prerequisite; lib/oEdtk/README added TODO items (embed fonts in PDF flows rather than vectorizing, optimize continuous flows (omgr), flatten PDFs so they are not a frame assembly).

